      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🛡️ Governor (Rust) — The Judge\nNo money moves until it says yes\nChecks: Is it allowed? Is it safe?\nHas it been done before? (idempotency)\n\nHolds rzp_test_* / rzp_live_*",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 85,
      "containerId": "gov-box",
      "originalText": "🛡️ Governor (Rust) — The Judge\nNo money moves until it says yes\nChecks: Is it allowed? Is it safe?\nHas it been done before? (idempotency)\n\nHolds rzp_test_* / rzp_live_*"
    },
