      "text": "POLICY — Hard Gates\n• max_refund 500k, velocity 10/h\n• payment_state == \"captured\"?\n• 500 ≤ 100k − 20k ? (checked)\n• missing → BLOCK (fail-closed)\n→ BLOCK if violated",
