      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Integer paise (i64, never float)\n   amount: 50000 paise = ₹500.00\n   validate → 400, not 500\n   \"14.99\" → reject fractional paise\n\n2. Balance: captured - refunded\n   100000 - 20000 = 80000 available\n   90000 > 80000 → BLOCK (checked sub)",
